      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَعَبَهُ</span></b> , aor. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَعِبُ</span>, (inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَعْبٌ</span>, Msb;) and
